   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "ie Moon and Mercury are from the trader class while",
   "bbox": [
    333,
    291,
    1467,
    348
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Saturn is shudra. The qualities of Mercury do not go well with",
   "bbox": [
    262,
    341,
    1466,
    399
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "those of a shudra. We are therefore, inclined to accept",
   "bbox": [
    263,
    392,
    1470,
    449
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Parashar as against Varah Mihir.",
   "bbox": [
    264,
    449,
    933,
    502
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "<b>Traits of Mars and Mercury</b>",
   "bbox": [
    263,
    545,
    987,
    595
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "विप्रादित: शुक्रगुरू कुजार्को शशी बुधश्चेत्यसितोऽन्त्यजानाम्।",
   "bbox": [
    337,
    612,
    1192,
    678
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "चन्द्रार्कजीवा ज्ञसितौ कुजार्की यथाक्रमं सत्त्वरजस्तमांसि ।। 7 ।।",
   "bbox": [
    337,
    675,
    1259,
    744
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Mars has a fierce glance, is young, is liberal, full of heat,",
   "bbox": [
    337,
    768,
    1474,
    826
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "very naughty, narrow at the region of the waist. Mercury is",
   "bbox": [
    264,
    818,
    1476,
    877
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "clever in speech, jocular in spirit, contains all the three",
   "bbox": [
    269,
    867,
    1473,
    929
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "humours ie wind, bile and phlegm.",
   "bbox": [
    270,
    929,
    963,
    975
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "<b>Traits of Sun and Moon</b>",
   "bbox": [
    270,
    1026,
    890,
    1074
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "मधुपिङ्गलदृक्चतुरस्रतनुः पित्तप्रकृतिस्सविताल्पकचः।",
   "bbox": [
    342,
    1104,
    1088,
    1159
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "तनुवृत्ततनुर्बहुवातकफ: प्राज्ञश्च शशी मृदुवाक्शुभदृक्।। 8 ।।",
   "bbox": [
    343,
    1167,
    1204,
    1224
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Sun has eyes of the colour of honey, a broad-square body,",
   "bbox": [
    347,
    1250,
    1478,
    1307
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "dominant in bile and with scanty hair. The Moon has a weak",
   "bbox": [
    274,
    1299,
    1483,
    1359
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "body, round in figure, with plenty of phlegm and wind,",
   "bbox": [
    274,
    1351,
    1481,
    1411
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "learned, gentle in speech and with attractive eyes.",
   "bbox": [
    274,
    1403,
    1277,
    1462
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "<b>Traits of Jupiter and Venus</b>",
   "bbox": [
    275,
    1508,
    1003,
    1560
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "क्रूरद्रक्तरुणमूर्तिरुदार: पैत्तिकस्सुचपल: कृशमध्य: ।।",
   "bbox": [
    349,
    1582,
    1099,
    1641
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "श्लिष्टवाक् सततहास्यरुचिर्ज़: पित्तमारुतकफप्रकृतिश्च।। 9 ।।",
   "bbox": [
    350,
    1644,
    1227,
    1704
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Jupiter has a long body, with brown hair and eyes, highly",
   "bbox": [
    353,
    1729,
    1486,
    1790
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "learned and with a humour of phlegm. Venus is happy and",
   "bbox": [
    279,
    1778,
    1486,
    1844
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "pleasure loving, handsome, charming in appearance, beautiful",
   "bbox": [
    280,
    1833,
    1489,
    1891
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "eyes and prone to phlegm and with curly black hair.",
   "bbox": [
    280,
    1885,
    1320,
    1944
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "<b>Traits of Saturn and others</b>",
   "bbox": [
    283,
    1991,
    997,
    2039
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "वृहत्तनुः पिङ्गगलमूर्द्धजेक्षणो वृहस्पतिः श्रेष्ठमतिः कफात्मकः।",
   "bbox": [
    353,
    2066,
    1237,
    2123
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "भृगुस्सुखी कान्तवपुस्सुलोचन: कफानिलात्मासितवक्रमूर्द्धज: ।। 10 ।।",
   "bbox": [
    357,
    2122,
    1350,
    2191
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "मन्दोऽलस: कपिलदृक् कृशदीर्घगात्र: स्थूलद्विज: परुषरोमकचोऽनिलात्मा।",
   "bbox": [
    354,
    2203,
    1389,
    2269
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "स्नाय्वस्थ्यसृक्त्वगथ शुक्लवसे च मज्जा मन्दार्कचंद्रबुधशुक्रसुरेडचभौमा: ।।11।।",
